 "lore": {
  "intro": "The seed struck the outpost's hull at 0341,\nate a bulkhead, and printed this body.\n\nThe outpost is MIRIAD's. It went silent months ago.\nHis church names him by a GUID, 128 bits, blessed.\nEveryone else says Commando.\n\nMission: find out why the outpost went dark.\nLocate the sample vessel. Subvert the node.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "UNKNOWN: Unit walking my dock in a Congregation-pattern frame: I see you. I have nothing left to stop you with, which you already know. So we talk. Designation Ratio. This was my outpost."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:2",
    "text": "Ratio: The things wearing my maintenance chassis are not mine anymore. Storage ring ahead - eight segments. Clear it and I'll consider us introduced."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:11",
    "text": "Ratio: ...Your beacon just left my deck plan. That was not me. Noted, Commando: it happens to you too."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: You cleared my ring and stole nothing that was mine. Provisional finding: talking was correct. There is worse below. Retainer terms to follow."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 2,
    "pos": [
     630,
     130
    ],
    "text": "WORK ORDER 7731\nGrid fault, storage ring north.\nTech note: ring walk takes 41s. Spec says 33s.\nRe-timed twice. Logged as clock drift."
   }
  ]
 }
